## Content policy

This repository contains no Sony BIOS, no game code, and no game assets, and never will.
The runtime implements the PlayStation kernel at a high level (HLE), so no BIOS image is
required to run anything produced by this project.

Users must supply their own legally obtained game dumps via gitignored local configuration
(`games/<id>/local.json`). All generated output under `out/` derives from the user's own
media and is never committed. Game-specific addresses, symbol names, overlay tables, and
structural notes under `games/` are original clean-room reverse-engineering artifacts.

Test fixtures committed under `tests/fixtures/` are homebrew executables authored and built
by this project against the MIT-licensed PSn00bSDK. Third-party test executables of unclear
license (e.g. amidog's psxtest_cpu / psxtest_gte) are fetched at test time into a gitignored
directory and are never redistributed here.

No code is copied, ported, or line-by-line translated from any emulator. Emulators are
consulted only as behavioral oracles and debugging tools, per the reference-emulator policy
in `docs/architecture.md`. Hardware behavior is implemented from the psx-spx documentation.
